      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "For what its worth Ive been using the auto-level button like a brake. Holding it angles the drone away from its direction of travel, and applies thrust, bringing it to a stop very quickly. \n\nThis is similar to how the 'emergency stop' mode on DJI drones already functions:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uIa_IFFG8w0\n\nIt is very immediate so maybe there could be some sliders to adjust its ramp up time. This would allow one to feather the brake to apply a little counter thrust to slow you down but not enough to stop you completely within 1s.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
